        "description": "Parts boxes over three lines in turn. A line with the limit of boxes on its way is skipped; when every line is at the limit the least loaded one takes the box. A box is on its way to a line while it holds that line's resource, so the model sets where on its way ends by where it releases the resource. The routing is Python code in the item (Code panel); it runs once you trust it.",
